  journalLore: The young of their kind, if trolls have young. They collect stones and throw them with great accuracy and no apparent malice, and they carry grudges for years.
  journalAdvice: It throws three stones, then has to recover. Dodge all three and close in during the recovery. Up close it has hands enough to parry a blow it sees coming from behind.
  journalHabitat: Rocky ground, with a good view and a supply of stones
